  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Falsos amigos",
    "@en": "False friends"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Soap** = jabón; **soup** = sopa. **Chef** = cocinero profesional; **boss** = jefe. **Bother** = molestar o preocupar; **delete** = borrar.",
     "@en": "**Soap** = soap; **soup** = soup. **Chef** = professional cook; **boss** = chief. **Bother** = bother or worry; **delete** = delete."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Consejos con if",
    "@en": "Tips with if"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Para dar una instrucción, usa **if + presente simple + imperativo**: **If you have a sore throat, drink water**. Para aconsejar con **should**, añade sujeto y **should + forma base**: **If you have a fever, you should rest**.",
     "@en": "To give an instruction, use **if + presente simple + imperativo**: **If you have a sore throat, drink water**. To advise with **should**, add subject and **should + forma base**: **If you have a fever, you should rest**."
    }
   ]
  },
